| $-4$ | $5$ | $-6$ | $7$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $h(x)$ | $-7$ | $6$ | $-5$ | $4$ | $-3$ | $6$ | $-1$ | $0$ |" :question/worked-solution "The range of $h(x)$ consists of all the outputs that have a corresponding $x$-input.\n\nIn a table, the range consists of all numbers that feature in the row corresponding to $h(x).$\n\nTherefore, the range is the set $\\{-7,-5,-3,-1,0,4,6\\}.$"}]}
